# ADR-deviation marker — fix/prepublish-write-bundled-manifest
- date: 2026-08-31
- branch: fix/prepublish-write-bundled-manifest
- adr_governing: ADR-002 (init safety) + ADR-007 (npm-lite bundling)
- outcome: ADR-honored via amendments
- rationale: |
    ADR-007 §D3 Amendment part 2 records the prepublish manifest-write
    contract (previously implicit; now explicit). Same Saltzer complete-
    mediation intent; adds Hoare postcondition that bundle carries the
    manifest.
    ADR-002 amendment records the removal of silent-catch on bundle-load
    failure. Same safety-envelope intent; sharper Nygard fail-with-fix
    discipline (per architect-review W3 finding).
    Both changes ADR-honored; no deviation from Saltzer / Linus / Cooper
    contracts.
